WEBVTT

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.860
Himeka...

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.290
Sugar? Is that you?

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.750
Himeka?

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.210
Eh?!

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.920
Ehh?!

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:27.000
Mom?!

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:04.470
M-Mom?

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:05.660
This way!

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.970
That ticket...

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:20.780
You're Sugar,

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:22.340
aren't you?

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:25.280
I finally found you! It's me, Himeka!

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.790
It's been so long!

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.280
But it really hasn't, has it?

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.750
I always come here when it snows...

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.010
Unbelievable.

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:38.970
I really found you!

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:41.930
The person Headmistress Ookanda used to trade tickets with...

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.140
It was your mother?

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:49.730
I'm so glad I found you! I've waited so long!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:52.770
You have no right to say that!

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:54.260
What?

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:57.240
Clearly "soul friends" was just my misunderstanding.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.720
You never came that day!

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:02.700
You broke your promise! You betrayed me!

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:06.420
No! I didn't betray you...

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:12.170
You, Sugar, were my one and only soul friend too.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:19.430
Umm, make it something mature!

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:21.900
Very well.

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:26.610
Do you want to register under your real name?

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:28.270
Eh, name?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.670
I wanna sound like a cool older sister type...

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:33.600
Himeka!

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:36.580
There.

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.110
Thank you!

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:49.150
Incredible!

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:50.920
Everything's so sparkly!

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:56.450
I went out and clipped coupons with lots of others and racked up shows, but...

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:58.400
Nothing ever really clicked.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.590
Another miss...

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:09.800
Here, you can have these!

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:15.020
Th-Thank you.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:18.190
I'm Himeka. Who're you?

00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:22.430
I'm Su-Sugar.

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:23.410
Susugar?

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.880
Sugar.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:25.950
Just Sugar.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:30.140
Oh, Sugar? What a hip name!

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:43.530
The days we spent together were so much fun.

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:49.830
It was brilliant.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:54.130
I thought I could never have a friend like you again.

00:04:54.780 --> 00:04:55.690
Why?

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:56.230
What?

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:58.690
Lala? You were here?

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:03.950
If she was such an important friend, why didn't you go meet her?

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.870
But I did go.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:13.750
Wha—

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.040
Weren't you the one who broke the promise, Sugar?

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.250
Wh-Whaaat?!

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:26.450
It was a snowy day, much like today.

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:30.360
I waited until dark.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:34.680
But I never saw you there.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.310
Th-That is impossible!

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:41.020
I'm certain I waited there all day!

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.670
How could that be?

00:05:42.670 --> 00:05:44.990
One of them must be lying.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.220
Spit it out, traitor!

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:52.290
I looked all over, inside and outside.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:55.250
So did I! Inside, outside, everywhere!

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:59.710
But... And you look completely different!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.920
Y-You're one to talk!

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:09.890
Could it be your appearance changed a lot in PriPara?

00:06:10.610 --> 00:06:15.580
So having only met inside, you just didn't recognize each other?

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:24.860
Oh yeah! We were really surprised when we first left together, too!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.190
It wasn't that different!

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:30.070
I just emphasized my strong points a little!

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.240
A little...

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:41.040
The minds of womenfolk are truly beyond my grasp.

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:46.760
There's a good chance you kept running past each other without realizing.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:55.180
That must have been it...

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:59.240
If only we'd realized then.

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:01.900
N-No, it couldn't be...

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:05.860
No. No, you won't fool me!

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:12.050
I would wait here every single day since then!

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:14.470
There had to be some explanation.

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:18.540
Today we might meet... Or tomorrow...

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:21.760
Well...

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:31.220
The day after we were supposed to meet, the principal of my school forbid all students from going to PriPara.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:38.790
We tried to convince her time and again, but to no avail.

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:42.520
Even going near the Prism Stone shop was forbidden.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.270
So I couldn't even come look for you.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:51.860
I waited for graduation and ran to PriPara right after the ceremony...

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:58.110
I looked for you all around PriPara for days.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.890
But I never did find you again.

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:09.140
The principal banned PriPara...

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:10.970
Just like our school.

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:13.930
If that rule hadn't been made...

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:18.610
But for some reason, I could never stop believing...

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:21.600
that one day I would see Sugar again.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.330
However long it took. Even if we grew up.

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:25.900
One day I would see you again.

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:31.860
Those wonderful days we spent in PriPara were not a lie.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:38.830
Whenever it snowed, like today, I would come here, hoping I might meet you.

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:41.040
And I finally did!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:49.200
So you became the headmistress,
and watched over my daughters all this time...

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:53.040
Maybe, deep down, I knew.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.280
Always fumbling with change at the restaurant...

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:59.190
You were bad with money back then, too.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:04.780
You really believed you'd find me for all these years?

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.640
Even today, you came here for that?

00:09:09.100 --> 00:09:13.520
And all that time I did nothing but lay blame on and hate you...

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:16.280
I couldn't stand even coming near PriPara.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.750
I'm the traitor here...

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:22.250
<i>I</i> ended that friendship.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:26.710
Well... How about we start it over, here and now?

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:30.670
I missed you, Sugar!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:37.010
I...

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.560
I missed you so much! So, so much!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.730
Himeka!

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:45.020
Sugar!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:53.400
Mom... Headmistress...

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:56.390
This is the power of friendship.

00:09:56.390 --> 00:09:57.360
Good grief.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.780
Friend Tickets don't expire.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:04.490
Even after all this time, they're as good as new.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:06.040
Manaka.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.080
Y-Yes?

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:09.290
You win.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:14.560
Seeing you on stage reminded me of those times.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.060
Afterwards, I wandered here in a daze.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.490
And learned the truth.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:24.350
To think one little rule could be so destructive to a friendship.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:32.490
It seems I have been profoundly mistaken.

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:39.030
There is something I must apologize for.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:48.660
Until recently, I had hated PriPara and believed friendship would inevitably lead to suffering.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:53.130
But I have come to realize the error of my ways.

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:58.470
Friends... Friendship is a wonderful, irreplaceable part of life!

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:06.080
And PriPara is a wonderful place where friends can deepen their bonds and chase after their dreams!

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:11.550
Tomorrow marks the beginning of winter vacation, and Christmas is not far behind.

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:15.440
Consider this a Christmas present from me!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:17.730
Come on, Rina!

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:24.830
Wow, amazing!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.370
There it is!

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:35.170
My PriTicket! I missed it!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.880
That's great, Nao!

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:38.760
Thanks, Lala!

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:43.030
I'll come see the Christmas show for sure!

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:43.590
Right!

00:12:02.590 --> 00:12:05.490
First time in PriPara... I can't wait!

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:07.790
It's really fun.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.090
Huh, what?

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:11.040
You've gone before, Manaka?

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:17.230
Set us up, please!

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:21.870
You're from Paprika Elementary School?

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.500
Congratulations on the rule change!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.590
Thank you!

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:29.070
Uhh, make it really trendy!

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:30.430
You...

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:36.030
have a very strong affection for ParaKappa.

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:36.560
What?

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:46.660
It's really cute.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.390
Uh, can we try this again?

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.100
Then how about this?

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.520
Oh yeah! I like it!

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:54.970
Looking good, Nao!

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:58.320
Just Manaka left.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:02.250
Capisce! Thanks for waiting!

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.720
Whaaat?!

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:09.910
Wow, you all look so cute!

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:12.450
SoLaMi SMILE's Lala?!

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:14.740
Okay, I'm off to practice now!

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:16.690
Okay, do your best with the show!

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:17.790
I will!

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:21.710
Today's Merry Christmas! Paradise Shoes Prize Grand Prix...

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:28.000
is not only one of the main events of PriPara, Idol Grand Prix, held once every three months,

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:32.740
it is also a rare chance to acquire the ultimate coord, the Paradise Coord: Paradise Prize!

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.310
ParaPri for short!

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:38.460
These two events together are huge-kuma!

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:47.090
Shoes, Tiara, Dress. New idols only get one shot at gathering all three-kuma!

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:50.080
And the team that wins the Paradise Coord...

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:53.000
Is basically guaranteed to reach the Divine Idol rank-kuma!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.560
So you absolutely <i>must</i> win-kuma!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:59.940
Especially against your biggest rivals, Dressing Pafé.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.320
Of course-pri!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:02.440
We've got this.

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:07.640
Oh? Where's your "capisce"?

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.160
C-Capisce!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.210
Lala? Something bothering you-pri?

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:12.410
Yeah...

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:15.800
Do we really have to win against Dressing Pafé?

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:16.860
Huh?

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.430
What is it, Shion?

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:25.850
I've had something on my mind after hearing the story of Ookanda and Lala's mother.

00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:31.300
I wish to live life to the fullest, leave no room for regrets.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:38.810
When our PriTickets were taken away, I thought... simply that I wanted to sing with you again.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:43.270
Me too. That's exactly what I thought.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.390
Me too.

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:48.900
Promise: Believe in friendship.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.910
Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:55.290
Paradise: Our goal.

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:59.160
We swear to stand on stage as one.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:07.800
<i>Those three have never been so in sync-usa!</i>

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:10.870
<i>Today's show is ours-usa!</i>

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:14.470
<i>I'm destined for the ranks of the Divine Managers-usa!</i>

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.930
Dressing Pafé!

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:20.390
I've got something I want to talk about!

00:15:24.320 --> 00:15:26.820
Huh? What nonsense is this-usa?

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:29.370
We obviously refuse-usa!

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:32.120
I had the same reaction at first.

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:35.530
But the more I think about it, the more it sounds like a great idea-pri.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:37.490
What do you think-pri?

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:39.960
Fine by me.

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:42.420
Dorothy!

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:45.670
As long as you don't mind being in my shadow.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.250
I want to try it, too.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:50.130
Interesting. Count me in!

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:53.270
I won't accept this-usa! Absolutely no way-usa!

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:55.670
Shaddup! I'll silence him!

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:57.100
I mean, convince him-kuma.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.280
Now hurry before the entries close-kuma!

00:15:59.280 --> 00:15:59.780
You're under arrest!

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:01.060
Yeah!

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:06.020
Merry Christmas! Paradise Shoes Prize Grand Prix!

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:10.990
The first of the 3 Paradise Coord items, Paradise Shoes!

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.080
The strongest teams in PriPara are vying for them!

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:17.450
Which of our teams will get the boots?

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.610
The competition starts now!

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:30.920
Let's welcome our first challenger, Teiko and NewMew!

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:34.020
So tight-new...

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:35.260
This is awful-mew...

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.760
Kyupikon!

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:49.440
It's like, all of these teams are so amazing...

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.550
And Dressing Pafé hasn't even shown up yet.

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:53.490
Can Lala's team really win?

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:57.120
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your Coord.

00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:00.240
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.150
Coord Change Start!

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:07.330
A Coord in the image of the Christmas Tree.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.340
A Christmas wreath on the chest.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:13.090
White Christmas Wreath Dress!

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:22.390
All those ornaments sparkling all over this dress and shoes!

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.980
White Christmas Ornament Dress!

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.410
Pri!

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:31.180
The fluffy parka is like fresh snow!

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:34.180
Sure to put PriPara in a Christmas mood!

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:37.160
White Christmas Colorful Ball Dress!

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:45.270
And our next competitor: SoLaMi Dressing!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.540
What!? Six members?

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:51.630
<i>Today's Christmas.</i>

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:55.010
<i>Together, we can give everyone the best possible show!</i>

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.720
I'm taking off.

00:17:58.040 --> 00:17:59.020
Have fun!

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:00.680
Be careficelle!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:23.800
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:29.350
Pshu...

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:34.360
Go.

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:39.700
There!

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:40.240
Pri!

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:41.530
Take that!

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:42.570
Eat this!

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:45.030
Pshu...

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:51.500
Let's have some fun! At PriPara Hills!

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:54.860
Good night.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:01.050
Cyalume Change!

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:05.930
Yay!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:06.450
Pri!

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:07.310
Go!

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.990
And the results:

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:56.390
Beating the competition and laying claim to the Paradise Shoes is...

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:58.620
The SoLaMi Dressing sextet!

00:20:58.620 --> 00:20:59.240
Alright!

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.020
Gotcha!

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:00.710
Go!

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:01.520
Tension Max!

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:02.400
Relax!

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:03.800
They did it-kuma!

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:05.320
They did it-usa!

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:21.500
I love you, Lala!

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:22.960
Good going! Now clip some tickets!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:25.090
You're all so cute!

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:31.010
Thank you, everyone!

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.950
Merry Christmas!

00:23:06.890 --> 00:23:08.780
Alright! PriPara's allowed!

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:12.240
No need to lay low while I work for the ParaPri!

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:16.340
Oh dear, the startups are getting so full of themselves. So annoying.

00:23:16.340 --> 00:23:18.720
Oh, hey there... Uniform?

00:23:18.720 --> 00:23:20.000
Unicorn!

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:22.080
What do you mean full of ourselves?

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:27.410
You'll see. Just enjoy it while it lasts!

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:30.620
Next time: It's Finally Her Debut!

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:32.680
Her? Who's she?

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:35.500
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
